Glyph outlines

The glyph outlines in DatabricksSymbolsNF-Regular.ttf are converted from the
SVG icons in the npm package @databricks/design-system 2.0.13, whose
package.json declares the ISC license (the published tarball ships no LICENSE
file and names no author; its repository field points to
https://github.com/databricks). Databricks and the Databricks logo are
trademarks of Databricks, Inc. This font is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Databricks, Inc.
